# Lab 10 – Unsupervised Learning

## Overview
This lab introduced unsupervised learning methods such as K-Means clustering and PCA.

## What I Learned
- How K-Means groups similar data points
- How the elbow method helps choose the number of clusters
- How PCA reduces dimensions while keeping important information

## Tools Used
- Python
- scikit-learn
- pandas
- matplotlib

## Reflection
This lab helped me understand how machine learning can find patterns in data without using labeled examples.
